  "post_content": "<p>El sal&oacute;n de actos del IES Serra d&#39;Espad&agrave;, en Onda, ha agogido la tarde de este mi&eacute;rcoles la charla D&eacute;ficit de Atenci&oacute;n: &iquest;qu&eacute; es? Implicaci&oacute;n familiar y escolar, organizada por el AMPA.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/01/IMG_0826.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>La ponente ha sido Charo D&iacute;ez, licenciada en Ciencias de la Educaci&oacute;n, magisterio en Educaci&oacute;n Primaria y formadora de transtorno de atenci&oacute;n con hiperactividad (TDAH) en la asociaci&oacute;n Apadahcas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradatdahiesserraespada/img_0823.jpg\" alt=\"img_0823\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradatdahiesserraespada/img_0830.jpg\" alt=\"img_0830\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradatdahiesserraespada/img_0831.jpg\" alt=\"img_0831\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradatdahiesserraespada/img_0835.jpg\" alt=\"img_0835\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
